      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏天一过就要直接正面对决让我不放心。\n还是在“天皇赏（秋）”之前，\n先让她参加别的竞赛确认状态比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd299a853abebaeeaaa8163f291ee8a9a60f192cfa2e94592dd5437270e4da7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
